{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1213419-do-you-allow-extempore-and-unfleshed-in-your-games","id":1213419,"title":"Do you allow extempore and unfleshed in your games?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-30T07:15:00-07:00","id":1213419,"title":"Do you allow extempore and unfleshed in your games?","content":"I'm running a promethean chronicle in about a month, and one of the players is interested in playing an extempore, and another one wants to play an unfleshed.<br /> Do you allow them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My English sucks. Sorry.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23549-toreadorgentleman","name":"ToreadorGentleman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T08:35:41-07:00","id":1213442,"title":"","content":"Haven't had the occasion to run Prommie, but would if I did. The players' experience is what matters, and any kind of special rarity is already relative given the general scarcity of Prometheans as a whole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T08:46:56-07:00","id":1213445,"title":"","content":"Same here. I doubt I'll ever manage to run Promethean, my players dislike it as much as I like it, but I would not object to anyone's table desire to play Unfleshed and Extempore.<br /> <br /> Prommies are weird and few, they have plenty of excuses to be special and bizarre. And if that would improve your players' enjoyement of the game, then it's even better.<br /> <br /> Unless you have strong narrative reasons to not allow them. Like, say, a main story arc. But generally speaking I'd think a lot before forbidding them even in that case: players have a better time when they get to play what they're interested with and it usually does come back and makes the experience better for all the people involved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T09:55:20-07:00","id":1213470,"title":"","content":"Since it's tangent to the discussion, we have a great post on these Forums with homebrew examples of the Unfleshed. It might possibly help you get over whatever reservations you have.<br /> <br /> Here's the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1013